"Grivecks look like giant hairless panthers with joints bent the wrong way."
"They are Artonan resource-world Avowed, and wear visored helmets and strap vests."
"Their language is Grivekcry, and their laughter sounds like choking."
"They dig new underground sleeping spots every four of their planet's days."
"They hunt and butcher their own meals and find eating others' kills disturbing."
"The System categorizes grivek classes and ranks differently from human ones."
"Their home planet is Sreeeakk, whose gravity is too strong for humans."
"Grivecks have an overactive prey drive; killing is their favorite pastime, though never mindless."
"Their culture accepts murder in many circumstances."
"Slaughtering someone after granting them contact permission would be monstrous to a griveck."
"Earth does not allow griveck tourists."
"Griveck Avowed are combat Avowed picking from a menu of skills and buffs, or a few Ryeh-b'ts."
"By agreement griveck Ryeh-b'ts are kept to a minimum and drawn only from the top ranks."
"Griveck Ryeh-b'ts try to turn domestic helper skills into combat ones."
"Grivecks have been allied with the Artonans for more than a millennium."
"Even non-Avowed grivecks kill with their tongues."
